Date: Thu Sep 04 09:04:06 2014 +0000

iCalendar Export  - create ICS files using Biweekly iCalendar library  - start/end times are exported in the current (server) time zone, with the appropriate time zone identification  - better handling of events with multiple meetings on a particular day  - this is to increase compatibility of UniTime ICS files (especially with Google Calendar)

